# tsan.supp — ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the EmbedIQ tsan CI job.
#
# Rule: a suppression is allowed ONLY for a race whose every frame is inside
# third_party/ (Paho MQTT C, mbedTLS). Never suppress a report with any frame
# in core/, osal/, hal/, fbs/, examples/ or tests/ — those are the findings
# the Set 2 fixes (F1–F7) must remove.
#
# Each entry carries a comment naming the TSan report's top frame and why the
# race is third-party-only.
#
# @author  Ritesh Anand
# @company embediq.com | ritzylab.com
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
